<title>PHILIPPINES: Kuok sets record date for stock dividend.</title>
<headline>Kuok sets record date for stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kuok Philippine Properties Inc said on Wednesday it had set July 8 as the record date for its 15 percent stock dividend.</p>
<p>The ex-stock is set on June 27.</p>
<p>-- Manila Newsroom (63 2) 841-8938 Fax 817-6267</p>
</text>
